  - w90_up.wout and w90_down.wout
 are the output for the library
  - w90random_up.amn and w90random_down.amn
 contain random projections
  - w90_up.amn and w90_down.amn
 contain projections
  - w90_up.mmn and w90_down.mmn
 contain the overlap
  - w90_up.eig and w90_down.eig
 contain the eigenvalues
 
